{"ID":"20240513083102-duzcvf6","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083102-duzcvf6","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083102-duzcvf6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513163743-fefid5d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513163743-fefid5d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:102,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513163743-fefid5d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:582,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:582\u0026#125;","title":"240","type":"doc","updated":"20240514161809"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513163743-fefid5d","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 772px;","id":"20240513163743-fefid5d","updated":"20240514161809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/4/23"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"193-1 H, L"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"52/瘦;中型"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/4/23"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"痰多,手腳冷,腹脹,腰酸,易抽筋(手掌尤甚),心慌,腳姆指麻,大便鬆,小便壓迫感,色黃微濁有泡沫,睡眠不佳,指甲(趾甲尤甚)乏光澤微糙,口偶微苦,偶耳鳴(蟬鳴聲)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 睡眠: 不易入睡, 睡眠時間短，易煩躁"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 大便: 每日行, 排氣多, 腹脹"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 小便: 深黃, 色濁, 小便時有不易排出現象(有尿道狹窄史)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 胃口: 尚好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 體力: 好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 體溫: 睡眠體溫尚好, 手足較冷"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 其它: 易為口水嗆到"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診： 心脈洪大有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 舌診：淡, 黃, 紅, 有齒痕"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"腹診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"壓天樞及下腹部拒按，右查腿足三里與闌尾穴一線有壓痛點"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 大腸中有燥矢"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 厚朴二錢  枳實二錢  大黃三錢  芒硝二錢分二包沖服   三付 前三味用3碗水煮成1碗,; 早晚飯前各半碗加芒硝沖服  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 每碗睡前一杯濃蔗糖水 (半杯蔗糖沖水為一杯蔗糖水)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"裡寒: 熱則縱,寒則縮; 因有裡寒,食道縮,故易嗆到; 小便時有不易排出  亦為尿道因寒而縮之故。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腹部臍旁有壓痛點/小便黃/大便鬆軟, 表有宿便擋到。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其它症狀分屬腎/肝臟,因有宿便,藥物下去不易收受,所以先攻宿便;肝有病必治大腸。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雖然他排氣多但要清宿便所以還是要用芒硝。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}